    "plain_text": "Ed Brown’s interest in motor racing began as a way to promote tequila. Sponsorship brought him into contact with Scott Sharp, who arranged driving lessons and helped turn a marketing project into a competitive career. Brown became a principal of Extreme Speed Motorsports and shared victories at Daytona and Sebring in 2016.\n\nHe also co-founded Selfless Love Foundation with his wife Ashley in 2015, making charitable work their wedding gift to one another. Her experience of adoption and his work with older foster youth shaped its purpose. The foundation combines adoption support with programmes helping young people move from foster care into independent adulthood.",
